rdiology\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nRadiology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nComprehensive Care Every Hour, Every Day for San Jose and Bay Area Pets\nMedVet Silicon Valley, conveniently located in the shopping center that houses the Grocery Outlet, serves as an extension of your family veterinarian, providing advanced emergency and specialty care from experts and board-certified specialists.\nAs part of our advanced veterinary care, we offer life-saving treatments for your pets including\ndialysis\n.\nMore than 15,000 patients come through our doors each year, and our trusted team treats each pet like our own. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional and compassionate care. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet and get them home with you where they belong.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.\nMedVet Silicon Valley Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nRadiology\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nAmanda Fiser, DVM\nMedical Director\nTerra Schropp RVT, VTS (ECC)\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nMontserrat Armero\n, DVM\nAlexandra Beaulieu\n, DVM, DVSc, DACVR\nRadiology\nCamille Brassard\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nKristine Chan\n, DVM, DACVIM (Cardiology), FAHA\nCardiology\nMonica Chen\n, DVM, MS, DACVS\nSurgery\nPamina Chong\n, DVM\nRavinder Dhaliwal\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology), DABVP\nMedical Oncology\nAmanda Fiser\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nLillian  Good\n, DVM, DACVECC\nCritical Care, Emergency Medicine\nThomas Hansen\n, DVM, DABVP\nEmergency Medicine\nDalal Hares\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nAlina Hernandez\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nRobin Kelly\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlison Leaver\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nChloe Letsinger\n, DVM\nAlicia Lucas\n, DVM, PhD\nLindsay Malcolm\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nRebecca McQuitty\n, DVM, DACVECC\nEmergency Medicine, Critical Care\nSolene Moreton\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nColin Reich\n, DVM, DACVECC\nCritical Care, Emergency Medicine\nSessaly Reich\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nLinda Ren\n, DVM\nAaron Rozental\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Neurology)\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nMichael Sahagian\n, VMD, DACVECC\nCritical Care, Emergency Medicine\nZara Thompson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nNoelle Tran\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nSierrah Travis\n, DVM, MS\nInternal Medicine\nJacob Tupper\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDerrick Wang\n, DVM\nErik  Wegner-Clemens\n, DVM, DACVIM (Neurology)\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nBradley Whelchel\n, DVM, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nSpencer Yeh\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nDaniel ZGodzay\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n33\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nSnow was admitted to MedVet for over half a week. The staff kept me updated daily! The doctors and vet techs were professional, friendly, and compassionate—exactly what you want when your fur baby is in ICU. They love Snow there so much. I’m grateful because I can still wake up knowing Snow is by my side.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Educatio